caption: Metabolic Protection
setting-component: metabolic-protection

A person who completes a valid sacrifice gains Immunity to Metabolic Hazards for one year. A later qualifying sacrifice refreshes the duration rather than multiplying the trait.

This creates a strong annual incentive to participate even among people who do not seek supernatural power or Blood Marks.
